after some more digging, i discovered that the arial fonts on my system had been disabled (the files had been placed in /Library/Fonts Disabled/), even though Font Book still reported Arial present, however this was the version stored in the Microsoft fonts directory (/Library/Fonts/Microsoft/).  i moved the fonts back from the disabled folder, the resolved the duplicate fonts from within Font Book.

